💥Justice Department Announces Monitoring of Polling Sites in Four Michigan Cities

“Our primary monitoring efforts continue today as we seek to ensure free and fair elections nationwide,” said AAGDhillon. “The Department of Justice is devoting extensive resources to ensure uniform and nondiscriminatory monitoring. We appreciate the cooperation of these jurisdictions in promoting trust and transparency.”
